ic anchor that rewards verifiable safety alignment precisely because the state controls enough purchasing volume to make verification economically rational without nationalizing corporate R&D. Failing to establish this enforcement anchor abandons civil safety to unconstrained market velocity where every unrecoverable failure falls directly on the public.",
